  "about": {
    "title": "About",
    "portrait": "Adjustments.jpeg",
    "paragraphs": [
      "William Liao is a 2nd generation Taiwanese-American passionate about using photography as a medium to experience and communicate the sometimes beautiful, often random miscellany of life.",
      "Concepts & imagery documented are intended to have a bidirectional relationship: at moments imagery are mediated through ideas, sometimes ideas through functional aesthetics",
      "Interested in connecting? Please feel free to reach out on LinkedIn!"
    ]
  },
